  ```

- **Comments**: Explain complex logic, not obvious code
  
  ```javascript
  // Don't do this
  const x = Math.max(a, b);  // Get the maximum
  
  // Do this
  // Sort by timestamp first, then by ID to ensure stable sort
  const sorted = items.sort((a, b) => a.created_at - b.created_at);
