## 8. Performance Considerations

### 8.1 Backend Performance

```python
# Avoid N+1 queries (use batch operations)
# Bad: Loop queries
for prompt_id in prompt_ids:
    prompt = storage.get_prompt(prompt_id)  # Multiple queries

# Good: Batch operation
prompts = [storage.get_prompt(id) for id in prompt_ids]

# Efficient filtering
# Bad: Filter in Python after fetching all
all_prompts = storage.get_all_prompts()
filtered = [p for p in all_prompts if p.collection_id == col_id]

# Good: Filter in storage/database layer
filtered = storage.get_prompts_by_collection(col_id)

# Cache frequently accessed data
