## 14. Debugging & Logging

### 14.1 Debugging Approach

```python
# Use logging, not print
import logging

logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)

def get_prompt(prompt_id: str) -> Optional[Prompt]:
    logger.debug(f"Fetching prompt: {prompt_id}")
    prompt = storage.get_prompt(prompt_id)
    if not prompt:
        logger.warning(f"Prompt not found: {prompt_id}")
    return prompt
```

